description: Laundry App Product Overview
alwaysApply: true
---

## Purpose

- Provide an on-demand laundry service platform connecting customers with laundry service providers (marts) and delivery partners.
- Eliminate the inefficiencies of traditional laundry services with digital ordering, tracking, and payment systems.
- Enable multi-tenant operation supporting multiple laundry marts with independent operations and branding.
- Support flexible pricing models (per-piece and per-kg) with real-time tracking and proof-of-service delivery.

## Problems Addressed

- Avoid manual order taking and tracking in laundry services
- Reduce customer wait times with scheduled pickup and delivery
- Bridge communication gaps between customers, laundry marts, and delivery partners
- Enable transparent pricing and real-time order tracking
- Provide proof of pickup and delivery with photo verification
- Simplify payment processing with multiple payment methods
- Enable data-driven business insights through analytics and reporting

## Core Modules

### Customer Management
- Customer registration and authentication with OTP verification
- Profile management (name, email, phone, saved addresses)
- Multiple address management with geolocation and default selection
- Order history and tracking by customer
- Customer-mart relationship tracking (orders, spending, ratings)
- FAQ and help section access
- Feedback and rating system

### Service Catalog
- Service category management (Regular Wash, Pro Clean, Luxury Care, Home Linens)
- Individual service definitions with pricing and duration estimates
- Clothing item catalog with per-piece pricing
- Per-kg pricing for bulk items
- Service icons and imagery
- Active/inactive service management
- Display order configuration for UI

### Order Management
- Dual pricing model support (per-piece and per-kg)
- Order creation with item selection and quantity
- Pickup and delivery scheduling
- Address selection for pickup and delivery
- Order status tracking (pickup → in_process → ready → out_for_delivery → delivered)
- Real-time order updates and notifications
- Order history and filtering
- Order cancellation and modification

### Billing & Payments
- Invoice generation with item-wise breakdown
- Delivery fee calculation based on distance
- Tax and discount application
- Multiple payment methods (Card, COD, UPI, Wallet)
- Payment status tracking (pending, completed, failed, refunded)
- Transaction ID tracking
- Digital receipts

### Delivery Management
- Delivery partner onboarding with document verification
- Real-time location tracking of delivery partners
- Delivery assignment for pickup and drop
- Route navigation and distance calculation
- Pickup and delivery proof with mandatory photo capture
- Delivery duration tracking (estimated vs actual)
- Delivery fee calculation
- Partner availability status management
- Delivery ratings and feedback

### Mart Administration
- Multi-tenant mart management with independent operations
- Dashboard with revenue, orders, and delivery analytics
- Daily metrics tracking (orders, revenue, completion rate)
- Customer relationship management
- Service and pricing configuration
- Delivery staff management and verification
- Order assignment and status updates
- Performance monitoring (ratings, delivery times)
- Promotional offers and discount management
- Report generation and export

### Analytics & Reporting
- Daily mart metrics (orders, revenue, cancellations)
- Customer spending patterns and retention
- Service popularity analysis
- Delivery performance metrics
- Revenue trends and forecasting
- Customer acquisition and engagement
- Staff performance tracking

## Architectural Principles

- Multi-tenant architecture supporting independent laundry mart operations
- Separate mobile applications for customers and delivery partners
- Admin web panel for mart management
- Real-time tracking and notifications
- Geolocation-based service radius and delivery fee calculation
- Photo proof verification for pickups and deliveries
- Flexible pricing models supporting different business needs
- Scalable REST API architecture with PostgreSQL database
- Cloud storage (S3) for images and documents
- Docker containerization for consistent deployment

